From 3c5d633e199cb3b88c16780c10aa46d07e5ffdc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: raffmont <raffaele.montella@uniparthenope.it>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 17:30:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Shared identity with the Construction Kit: /api/me username
 is the account username, public handle apart

- Principal.as_dict() returns the account username (shared over SSO) and public_handle;
  public_dict() is what other people see (multiplayer errors no longer send email).
- SSO sign-in shows the privacy notice once per version, like local sign-in.
- The notice gate answers /api/ calls in JSON (403 privacy_notice_required); /api/me
  reports privacy_notice_pending.
- An /api/ POST with no signed-in session and no Bearer token gets 401, not a CSRF 400.
- tests/test_shared_identity.py: contract, collision, rename, migration, notice, CSRF.
