diff --git a/docs/api.md b/docs/api.md
index 49fe8f2..1d7e7d6 100644
--- a/docs/api.md
+++ b/docs/api.md
@@ -47,6 +47,15 @@ Account email and login username are private. Public response fields such as
 safe public handle. Existing email-based profile URLs remain available only to
 that account and administrators during migration; anonymous requests receive a
 not-found response.
+
+`GET /api/me` is the signed-in user's own view. Its `username` is the private
+account username, the one shared with a linked PRG32-Construction-Kit over
+single sign-on; `public_handle` (also in `name`) is the public display name.
+Other people only ever see `public_handle`. While the user still has to
+acknowledge the current privacy notice, `/api/me` answers with
+`"privacy_notice_pending": true` and other `/api/` routes answer `403` with
+`"code": "privacy_notice_required"` instead of redirecting. A `POST` to an
+`/api/` route without a signed-in session or a Bearer token answers `401`.
 | `GET` | `/auth/me` | Current user JSON |
 | `GET` | `/auth/tokens` | List your Bearer tokens or open the token manager |
 | `POST` | `/auth/tokens` | Create a Bearer token |
