+The account username stays the sign-in name shared with a linked
+Construction Kit: SSO matches accounts by email, an imported account keeps the
+kit's username (or its email when another Store account already uses that
+username; accounts are never joined by username), and `/api/me` returns it only
+to its owner. The public handle is never derived from it for SSO imports.
+A user arriving by SSO sees the Store's notice once per notice version.
+
